{"id":"6f068c38418e21f2","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-gl-canonical-model.md","title":"GL Canonical Model","display":"df-gl-canonical-model — GL Canonical Model","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-gl-canonical-model","aliases":["89-df-gl-canonical-model"],"display":"df-gl-canonical-model — GL Canonical Model","depends_on":["[[89-df-canonical-model]]","[[89-df-gl-logic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-gl-canonical-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-gl-canonical-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gl-canonical-model — GL Canonical Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c922518c30c4107d\" href=\"?note=c922518c30c4107d\" title=\"89-df-canonical-model\">89-df-canonical-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathcal M_L)_{L}\">\\((\\mathcal M_L)_{L}\\)</span> is the canonical-model construction from\n<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c922518c30c4107d\" href=\"?note=c922518c30c4107d\" title=\"89-df-canonical-model\">89-df-canonical-model</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{M}^{\\mathrm{can}}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal{M}_{\\mathrm{GL}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{M}^{\\mathrm{can}}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal{M}_{\\mathrm{GL}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>规范模型的世界是极大一致集</li>\n<li>此处只是把参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 实例化为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span>，不使用未定义的函数限制记号。</li>\n<li>要把该结构用于 GL 的 Kripke 完全性，还需有限化/过滤等后续论证；\n本别名本身不声称其框架已经满足全部 GL 框架条件。</li>\n<li>规范模型是模态逻辑的标准技术</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-canonical-model","status":"resolved","id":"c922518c30c4107d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-canonical-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-canonical-model","status":"resolved","id":"c922518c30c4107d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(\\mathcal M_L)_{L}$ is the canonical-model construction from\n[[89-df-canonical-model]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"(\\mathcal M_L)_{L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{M}^{\\mathrm{can}}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal{M}_{\\mathrm{GL}}.","display":true},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}","display":false}],"bytes":998,"backlinks":[{"id":"70714818ed137ea4","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"co